{"occurrence_no":"1559205","record_type":"occ","collection_no":"133792","identified_name":"Coroniceras sp.","identified_rank":"genus","accepted_name":"Coroniceras","accepted_rank":"genus","accepted_no":"14719","early_interval":"Semicostatum","late_interval":"Turneri","max_ma":199.5,"min_ma":192.9,"reference_no":"76704","lng":"4.739167","lat":"47.058887","cc":"FR","latlng_basis":"stated in text","latlng_precision":"seconds","geogscale":"outcrop","geogcomments":"An outcrop corresponding to a trench in the former railway line known as the \"Tacot Saulieu\" which led from Beaune Semur-en-Auxois via Saulieu (Côte d'Or). The cut is located in the region of Mavilly-Mandelot (Côte d'Or) about 300 m west of the town of Mandelot slightly above the main road D32d.","environment":"carbonate indet.","primary_reference":"M. Corna and J.-L. Dommergues. 1995. Les ammonites du Sinémurien de Mandelot (Côte-D'or, France). Approches biostratigraphique, morphologique et ontogénétique [The ammonites from the Sinemurian of Mandelot (Côte-d'Or, France). Biostratigraphic, morphologic and ontogenetic approaches]. Geobios 28(1):17-47","phylum":"Mollusca","phylum_no":"7805","class":"Cephalopoda","class_no":"12315","order":"Ammonitida","order_no":"84931","family":"Arietitidae","family_no":"204843","genus":"Coroniceras","genus_no":"14719"},
